{"id":"3e2e6a2f5d909f84","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Quotient Poset Order","display":"df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order — ZFC Order11 Quotient Poset Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order — ZFC Order11 Quotient Poset Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order — ZFC Order11 Quotient Poset Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e668662ec71d852\" href=\"?note=2e668662ec71d852\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,P,E,x,y\">\\(R,P,E,x,y\\)</span> (order parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11QuotientPosetOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11QuotientPosetOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in V\">\\(Q\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2e668662ec71d852\" href=\"?note=2e668662ec71d852\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}poset\\text{-}order}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11QuotientPosetOrder}_S(R,P,E,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall x,x&#39;,y,y&#39;\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,x&#39;\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,y&#39;\\rangle\\in E\n\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\leftrightarrow\\langle x&#39;,y&#39;\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)\\land R\\subseteq Q\\times Q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n(\\langle\\{u\\in P:\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in E\\},\\{v\\in P:\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in E\\}\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}poset\\text{-}order}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11QuotientPosetOrder}_S(R,P,E,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall x,x&#39;,y,y&#39;\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,x&#39;\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,y&#39;\\rangle\\in E\n\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\leftrightarrow\\langle x&#39;,y&#39;\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)\\land R\\subseteq Q\\times Q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n(\\langle\\{u\\in P:\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in E\\},\\{v\\in P:\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in E\\}\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>序同余条件保证商序不依赖代表元；原式没有声明底层序也没有要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 与该序相容。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q\\in V$；$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,P,E,x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11QuotientPosetOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}poset\\text{-}order}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11QuotientPosetOrder}_S(R,P,E,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\forall x,x',y,y'\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,x'\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,y'\\rangle\\in E\n\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\leftrightarrow\\langle x',y'\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)\\land R\\subseteq Q\\times Q\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n(\\langle\\{u\\in P:\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in E\\},\\{v\\in P:\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in E\\}\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":1874,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2898","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order.md|58-df-zfc-order11-quotient-poset-order]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5","908bc7b079f5d25b","599d16bb1d9ed41c","2e668662ec71d852"]}